    {
      "@id": "#step-pathway_enrichment",
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "additionalType": "computation",
      "name": "Test pre-defined gene sets (KEGG / Reactome / GO / MSigDB hallmark) against\nranked DE results. fgsea / clusterProfiler / GSEA / enrichr selected at runtime.\n\nRanking gene sets needs an entity-label ↔ accession mapping (the DE table is\nkeyed by Ensembl accession; gene sets are keyed by symbol or Entrez id), so\nthis stage necessarily resolves one. Write it out as\nannotation/symbol_map.tsv — tab-delimited, header `symbol` then\n`ensembl_gene_id`, one row per distinct mapping, sorted by accession — under\nthis task's own output dir and NOT under intermediates/, which the deposit\nexport drops. This mapping comes from the pinned genome annotation\n(org.Hs.eg.db / biomaRt) rather than from the literature join, so it is the\nINDEPENDENT source the entity-label ↔ accession consistency check needs in\norder to catch a citation attached to the wrong entity.\n",
      "position": 40
    },
    {
