der intermediates/ — the deposit export drops\nevery intermediates/ path, so a join left there is absent from the deposit.\nThe library then records the mapping it read as the declared artifact\nannotation/symbol_map.tsv (tab-delimited, header `symbol` then\n`ensembl_gene_id`, one row per distinct mapping, sorted by accession). Do\nNOT hand-write, rename, or post-edit that file, and do not invent a\ndifferent filename for it: it is the table the independent\nentity-label ↔ accession consistency check reads.\n\nThe library derives PMIDs, quotes, offsets, source hashes and prior\ndirections from the retrieved snapshots themselves, and the analysis\ndirection from the sign of the effect column. Do not pass any of them in,\nand do not post-edit the emitted CSV.\n",
